utcomes, including finite below-bar/non-improving members, remain in the unchanged whole-five historical quality statistic.\",\n    \"Original served index0 independently satisfies its own exact learning/reference and unchanged external/historical bar restrictions; no outcome-selected serving index.\",\n    \"Exact admitted served bytes, original source/device provenance, authentic replay, completion, Store and lane admission remain mandatory.\",\n    \"Historical calibrated-floor provenance remains explicitly limited; finite canonical learning does not claim population probability or published-model parity.\",\n    \"All11 supervised recipes keep canonical base+[0..4] and fixed heldout labels/targets. Only California allocation becomes100epochs/700000examples/5500updates perseed, batch128/tail88, finalepoch100. Other10SL allocations stay exact; all paired initial/final predicates and bars remain unchanged.\",\n    \"Classification retains exact finite uniform/majority signal restrictions and strict own-initial gain; regression retains strict own-initial gain and both prescribed constant predictors.\"\n  ],\n  \"tuning_scope\": \"The remaining tuning row retains seed1729/trials128 and its existing optimization contract; these scopes do not convert it into a five-seed native/supervised learning claim.\",\n  \"compatibility_review\": {\n    \"file\": {\n      \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/california-default100-source-bound-compatibility-note-20261027.json\",\n      \"bytes\": 11327,\n      \"sha256\": \"f53a6ef98de7303f3411eb37d5ec33d97cfd80a1097e44a5a460591f6e60f2ce\"\n    },\n    \"role\": \"Fresh source-bound review of the explicitly approved California allocation revision with unchanged finite quality criteria. All C2/605/9b reviews and all failed acquisitions remain literal historical material; this note supplies no new learning or independent test-set claim.\",\n    \"content\": {\n      \"domain\": \"jitml-phase278-california100-native-criterion-s